SWEET FG charger (patch 0159): plug and charge state from the MAX77759 charger (I2C 0x69 on HSI2C12, ADT /sweet-fg chg-i2c-addr). sweet_fg_charger() reads CHG_INT_OK and CHG_DETAILS_00/01/02 (0xB4-0xB7, 8 bit) through the same checked, save-and-restore transfer code as the gauge, read only; sweetfg=2 prints them. SweetBattery (sweetbattery=2) sets external = an input valid (CHGIN_OK/WCIN_OK) and its switch closed (CHGIN_STS/WCIN_STS), charging = external and CHG_DTLS 0-3, full = external and CHG_DTLS 4 or 100 %, as Google's max77759_charger.c does (:1907-1920, :1980-2006); without a charger answer it keeps the current-based guess of 0158 and publishes SweetBatteryChargerKnown false. The battery log line repeats when plug or charge state changes.

